<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 572.45, up 3.29.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 335 to 196.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,127,210, compared with 18,539,990 Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
